# <type>(<scope>): <description>
#
# Types: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, test, chore, security
# Scope: module or area (e.g. wui, quantum, ci)
# Use imperative mood, lowercase after subject. Optionally add:
# Refs #123 | Fixes #123 | Security: brief impact
#
# Examples:
#   feat(wui): add local hardware execution mode
#   fix(quantum): resolve path injection in credential persist
#   docs(api): update auth section
#   security(auth): fix SQL injection in login (CVSS 9.8)
#
# Leave the first line above as your subject; delete these comment lines before committing.